= Ellen Wilkinson

Ellen Wilkinson is a joint member of Labour and the British Communist Party. Previously a member of the NUWSS suffrage group, the AUCE trade union, being involved in activism and strike organising since university. A vocal critic of British imperialism. Being the party's left wing, she believes big socialist reforms are the way forward and opposes gradualist incrementalism.

